Nicely done! Oh, and smart to have spare stuff outside the bag. :)

Protection loss is terrible because priests will charge as if you
already had been given divine protection - in other words, if you
bought nine units before the mishap, you'll only have a 1/10 chance of
getting protection with each purchase. If it's possible in your game,
eating charged-up rings of protection when polymorphed is actually a
faster way to get protection late game, but it's sort of gimmicky.


